  {
    "id": 2023004040030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──雛菜、前からこの雑誌読んでたので\r\nすっごくうれしいです～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "本当ですか？\r\nありがとうございます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "それでは、最後に\r\n市川さんのこの先の展望を教えて下さい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\nこの先の展望、ですか～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "ふふ、難しいですよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～\r\nそうじゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "学校でもこの間、進路のこと聞かれて\r\n雛菜まだ１年生なのに～って思ったので",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "なるほど！\r\nそうだったんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "ここではそんなに難しく考えずに\r\nこんなことをしてみたい、とかでも大丈夫ですよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜は楽しくしあわせ～に\r\nアイドルしていきたいなって思ってて",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "アイドルっていうか、それだけじゃなくて……\r\n楽しくしあわせでいることが雛菜なので",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そういう雛菜でいられるのはもしかしたら\r\nアイドルなんじゃないかな～？　って",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今は、そういうふうに思ってます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "……そうですか\r\nそれは……いいですね！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "ファンの方もきっと市川さんの幸せな姿が\r\n見たいでしょうし",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "そういう姿にファンの方は\r\n元気をもらっているはずですから！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\nあは～、そうですよね～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜もそう思います！\r\nだからそのために、色々やってみたいと思って～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "楽しくて、しあわせになれそうなことなら、\r\n……なんでも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "──はい、ありがとうございます！\r\nこれでインタビュー終了させていただきます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、すっごく楽しくて\r\nあっという間に終わっちゃった～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──あ、そうだ！\r\n最後に絶対やりたいこと、思いつきました！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "おおー！\r\nなんですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "絶対絶対、またこの雑誌に出たいです！\r\nまた呼んでくださいね～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040180"
  },
