  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──雛菜、お疲れ様\r\n撮影もインタビューもよかったぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、ほんとに～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも雛菜、\r\n思ったことを言っただけだよ～？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nじゃあ、それがすごくよかったってことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサー、この間\r\n進路調査の紙、見つけてくれたでしょ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そのときに思ったんだよね\r\n雛菜の思うとおりでいいんだな～って",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、当たり前だよね\r\n雛菜のことなんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040250,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "怒られてもだめだって言われても\r\nやりたいことはやりたいし～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040260,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "楽しくしあわせ～でいたいでしょ？\r\n雛菜も、きっとみんなも",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040270,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──だからやっぱり\r\n雛菜、アイドル向いてるかも！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これから、もっと色々なことに挑戦して\r\n雛菜の可能性を広げていこう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルとしても、ひとりの人としても",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺も、一緒に挑戦していくからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040280,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……、\r\n大変そうじゃなければね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023004040290,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それで、楽しくてしあわせで\r\nいられそうなことならね～～～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300404/2023004040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………はは、\r\nそうだよな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
